/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Equip your Mech:</strong> Upgrade your systems, weapons and manage your deck. 3 Mechs available right now!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>City Fortress:</strong> Buy Artillery, turrets and other combat assets that you can carry in your Mech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Destruction:</strong> Push and pull the buildings, build obstacles, use them as firing cover or even crush the angels between buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Save the Citizens:</strong> Make sure the population is evacuated in time, the governments will reward you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Replay:</strong>\u00a0It's a roguelike! And there are plenty of game modes to keep you busy</p></li></ul>","developers":["Massive Galaxy Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332970/31e7be1bcbf4576facb89ad8c60813c95f1207ab/header.jpg?t=1763983509","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2332970/2066735578/c1c827df4c941ce4ba1352ad4c8dffff9a58619c/1758135737/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758139155","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2332970/2066735578/c1c827df4c941ce4ba1352ad4c8dffff9a58619c/1758135737/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758139155","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2332970/2066735578/c1c827df4c941ce4ba1352ad4c8dffff9a58619c/1758135737/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758139155","id":257200275,"name":"ARC SEED 1.0 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://share